            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"results\">Results</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Once the database has been built, you can view a sample from the whole-of-government analytical table as follows:\n<div class=\"language-sql codehilite\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"k\">SELECT</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">FROM</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">pses_wog</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">LIMIT</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">50</span>\n</code></pre></div></span></span>"
